{"unit_id":"tag:08XD:statement","translation":"若<MATH_0001>作为<MATH_0002>模（module）具有以下性质之一\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<ITEMOPEN_0001>(a)<ITEMCLOSE_0001>有限生成（finitely generated）；\n<ITEMOPEN_0002>(b)<ITEMCLOSE_0002>有限表示（finitely presented）；\n<ITEMOPEN_0003>(c)<ITEMCLOSE_0003>平坦（flat）；\n<ITEMOPEN_0004>(d)<ITEMCLOSE_0004>忠实平坦（faithfully flat）；\n<ITEMOPEN_0005>(e)<ITEMCLOSE_0005>有限（finite）投射（projective）；\n<STRUCT_0002>\n则<MATH_0003>作为<MATH_0004>模（module）也具有该性质（反之亦然）。\n","allowed_english":["a","b","c","d","e"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"finitely generated","target_term":"有限生成"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表示"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限"},{"source_term":"projective","target_term":"投射"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"两环上的模；待批准。"},{"source_term":"finitely generated","target_term":"有限生成","context":"模的性质 (a)；待批准。"},{"source_term":"finitely presented","target_term":"有限表示","context":"模的性质 (b)；待批准。"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"模的性质 (c)；待批准。"},{"source_term":"faithfully flat","target_term":"忠实平坦","context":"模的性质 (d)；待批准。"},{"source_term":"finite","target_term":"有限","context":"有限投射模；待批准。"},{"source_term":"projective","target_term":"投射","context":"模的性质 (e)；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08XE:statement","translation":"若<MATH_0001>作为<MATH_0002>代数（algebra）具有以下性质之一\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<ITEMOPEN_0001>(a)<ITEMCLOSE_0001>有限型（finite type）；\n<ITEMOPEN_0002>(b)<ITEMCLOSE_0002>有限表示（finite presentation）；\n<ITEMOPEN_0003>(c)<ITEMCLOSE_0003>形式非分歧（formally unramified）；\n<ITEMOPEN_0004>(d)<ITEMCLOSE_0004>非分歧（unramified）；\n<ITEMOPEN_0005>(e)<ITEMCLOSE_0005>平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）；\n<STRUCT_0002>\n则<MATH_0003>作为<MATH_0004>代数（algebra）也具有该性质（当然，反之亦然）。\n","allowed_english":["a","b","c","d","e"],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表示"},{"source_term":"formally unramified","target_term":"形式非分歧"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebra","target_term":"代数","context":"两环上的代数；待批准。"},{"source_term":"finite type","target_term":"有限型","context":"代数的性质 (a)；待批准。"},{"source_term":"finite presentation","target_term":"有限表示","context":"代数的性质 (b)；待批准。"},{"source_term":"formally unramified","target_term":"形式非分歧","context":"代数的性质 (c)；待批准。"},{"source_term":"unramified","target_term":"非分歧","context":"代数的性质 (d)；待批准。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"代数的性质 (e)；待批准。"}],"notes":[]}
